{"id":10000086,"name":"莱欧斯利","enName":"Wriothesley","title":"寂罪的密使","element":"冰","region":"枫丹","rarity":5,"weapon":"法器","birthday":"11月23日","constellation":"守狱犬座","description":"梅洛彼得堡的公爵，隐于漆黑海底的领主。","affiliation":"梅洛彼得堡","cv":{"chinese":"刘北辰","japanese":"小野大辅","english":"乔·齐贾","korean":"权昌旭"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000086-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000086-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Wriothesley.zip","voicePackageEn":"Wriothesley","quoteCount":66,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"你好，请尽量简洁地说明你的来意。嗯？不是公事？那我反而更紧张了。\n坐下详谈吧。顺便一提，你可以称呼我「公爵」，他们都是这么叫的，我也听习惯了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/0k47kartqj55rnb1rb10d6liozpp1fo.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·贴纸","desc":"如果看到我背后粘着美露莘画的贴纸，帮我揭掉吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/94/3cpekk1u1y2fri3iejn7euxstiarrun.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·宠物","desc":"我曾经考虑过要不要在办公室里养宠物，但小猫小狗在不见阳光的地方生活太可怜了。还是算了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/42vuxsbrycj69rgy8if32ugyj7rcdw4.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·忠告","desc":"不要违法。还有什么需要叮嘱的吗？哦对了，不要违法。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2c/92ctdn3lhzfslnx2srzor97n9qr2a1c.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"下雨了？还好。要是在梅洛彼得堡感到头顶滴水的话，问题可就大了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/06/qep4vx9thp67yd1gicbjreiz3rxbckj.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"心中无罪的人，在这种天气下也能安睡吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/8csw6ztmo00zbparu2c0ro5dv2c3w0i.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"嗯…和水下的冷不太一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/appinmjr0m1goqn38ug84aangfm74jn.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"「太阳之下无新事」，但可以找个好地方野餐。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3b/q9w8k3b9demzk4gds104d7hojk8ex7l.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早。晨报上的天气预测怎么说？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/91/me83woy0xusvuddvcijlerhnmw3zixn.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"现在特许食堂人正多，我叫人送餐到办公室来吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/81/dqujhu4gu6i7oqadqmcyeb8zw5l2fd7.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"都这个时间了？总觉得才刚刚喝过下午茶。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/l60lp1focw23p8p818c6q8vwb3t3uu3.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"晚安。我要等会儿再睡，趁夜深人静正好算几笔账。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2a/sc5ve01y1rxvw7b2sv13xyzca6b175y.mp3"},{"title":"关于莱欧斯利自己·误解","desc":"他们不是把我想得太神秘，就是太全能了。我只有一双眼睛、一对耳朵，怎么可能照顾到梅洛彼得堡的每一个角落呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/h8u9gm4jajv0wy2eya4a4r760wjc6g8.mp3"},{"title":"关于莱欧斯利自己·小憩","desc":"我早已服完刑，现在是自由公民，当然可以来水上闲逛。\n不必担忧。要是梅洛彼得堡必须要我一直待在下面才能稳定运转，那也太不健康了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d2/36p1frj92poc83pt1ql2lbfnxcll8bc.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·收监","desc":"我对很多人的第一印象都是从收监登记表开始的，看来你也没能例外。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/kbgku9zpmm6qyf4gvs61zayiuohzhxq.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·出狱","desc":"都说没了利益牵扯才好做朋友，我们可以现在开始。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/16/36b6pjygwrwvg2knoyqzv10ksvyn0oi.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"我以前跟一些罪人学过借助化学药剂使用元素的方法。无论「神之眼」的发放归哪个部门管，他们似乎不是很介意这点僭越之举。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/45/3keghnq1dxatxehlx05bl3xnxhakb6b.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"知道怎么做更容易逃脱警备队的抓捕吗？给自己起个又长又难记的名字，然后他们在大喊「那个谁，把手举起来！」时就会卡壳。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/7olovi8ex58atykmq2adzfoi8sp1m9m.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"「不劳动者不得食」，这句话很久以前就刷在梅洛彼得堡墙上了。我也不知道是谁安排的，在水下的确很实用。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/lkcs59nrnmb7n3vqpzl5nbqto28yek9.mp3"},{"title":"关于那维莱特…","desc":"记得有次被那维莱特叫去上面谈事情，走到沫芒宫门口正好看到他在路边淋雨。我替他打了伞，他礼貌地道了谢，表情却不大自然。我大概是打扰到了什么吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_neuvillette_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/5o9r5snxn1myv23rt56xt5x7dmfxxmk.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"可能是因为我认罪太快，芙宁娜小姐在当年的审判中看起来兴致索然，早早就退场了。让水神大人失望可是大事，只好今后多给她送些好茶了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/sngwgiuy5i6701su5hkch8tcd9wm5g6.mp3"},{"title":"关于希格雯…","desc":"希格雯护士长具备一名医护人员所需的全部美德，并关心着身边每一位同伴。\n不过她似乎从我身上学走了一些坏习惯，比如时常和她的美露莘朋友们打赌，看谁能偷偷在我的东西上贴更多贴纸。不，我并不觉得困扰。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_sigewinne_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/mvzq8onmltn2fxxbx3wt94wmnhaf5ih.mp3"},{"title":"关于克洛琳德…","desc":"克洛琳德应该是你能找到的最好的决斗代理人了，实力有目共睹。我从未和她比试过，没有那个必要。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_clorinde_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/91/9tiu68u5f6gmtgz6iskh3vhc6z18ypq.mp3"},{"title":"关于林尼…","desc":"我承认，拔除「壁炉之家」安插在水下的眼线是种挑衅。而他们的回应是只派几个孩子下来，的确令我有些难办。是真心觉得他们也可以被牺牲，还是看准了我不会对小孩下狠手呢…唉。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_lyney_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/1j1xjbsojjxtqeiknytiwgsr473gyop.mp3"},{"title":"关于娜维娅…","desc":"梅洛彼得堡和刺玫会有一些物资方面的合作，但仅限于此。并不是不信任娜维娅小姐或是质疑她的能力——实际上恰恰相反——只不过，我们之间水下水上的事务互不干涉是我与卡雷斯先生约好的规矩，维持不变就好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_navia_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ec/pr8r6owpj9ew3yyrklge12dnzvzghfu.mp3"},{"title":"关于艾梅莉埃…","desc":"梅洛彼得堡应该用不上她的服务，有些痕迹就是作为「前车之鉴」被留下来的。…气味也是痕迹的一种，不是吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_emilie_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/jyq950mcuxfk8qt47399uzyjfot5w6a.mp3"},{"title":"关于夏沃蕾…","desc":"被特巡队关照过的犯人大多挺老实的，这位队长功不可没。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_teammate_chevreuse_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/10/i6jgpxswdgs07lfidzumx7e2z4ovf1k.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱欧斯利·其一","desc":"理论上来讲，完全不认识我的人会比较幸福。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/230dimp6xzngk1t3zeccz41lzf9w31r.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱欧斯利·其二","desc":"身上的疤痕？曾有深海巨兽企图占领梅洛彼得堡，我和它搏斗时被抓伤了。…当然是假的，不要信。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/57/ntn4dgnp6tp1ix18ibis1j67kda3j65.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱欧斯利·其三","desc":"你知道吗，手铐只要型号相近，大部分都能用通用的钥匙打开。只有我这副不一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3e/9t0s8vhystv8pf2vaa3bt8dz5poh6gj.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱欧斯利·其四","desc":"我的个人能力其实很有限。你看，我既不会治病，也不会搞发明，更不会造大船。我只是知道该去哪里找人做这些事，而他们恰好愿意卖我这个面子而已。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/n8t5uxwhlclq6mx9fg27iq9ga73p592.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解莱欧斯利·其五","desc":"我现在过上了还不错的生活，但也仍然羡慕一些我得不到的东西——比如安逸快乐的童年，和轻易信赖他人的能力。可能有人认为这很矛盾，或者难以启齿，我倒觉得没什么不好承认的——何必和自己的本心过不去呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/ocs19lhowo424tiwlqg61gfviw5aqut.mp3"},{"title":"莱欧斯利的爱好…","desc":"拳击？不算是爱好吧，只是生活所需。你有什么其他推荐吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/akbnbygdeq7gy4cws9hs2gthtr2m20e.mp3"},{"title":"莱欧斯利的烦恼…","desc":"我确实有着枫丹人的长相，但没法百分之百肯定——只能跳胎海水确认咯？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/6lgj9g19h0xquvwv9zwnorspc4rq5pt.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"喝咖啡时我习惯加奶，茶的话，两块糖就好了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/fjit1udlfaripouqskubn1k22ktuwfp.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"你喝过护士长做的奶昔吗？能从中尝出…「荒芜」的味道。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/2xblxs8du7bswgufpeuekce8fexltgr.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"完美的调味，我就不擅长这个。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/81ql0bb1gkuay6hg99jnukfnkq5gnss.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"好吃。下次换我请客。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/6agmbmajk3qzgsfht8r58qb2faaf0im.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"等我去泡杯茶。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/84tgmpust8lwq4s6h2lg8yonsbukgtz.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"枫丹的孩子是伴随着双亲的心愿与祝福诞生的，不过我愿意相信这世上的每一个人都是如此。和这个比起来，我的祝愿就有些微不足道了。\n不，如果你犯事的话我是没办法帮你减刑的，只能在今天给你安排一份特殊的福利餐。所以生日期间还是安分一点，保证我们可以在水上庆祝，好吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/8pe00urzf5izrtdjt43qmubbpkzzw59.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"能获得你的信任，是我的荣幸。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/7s1okwvtzbq5ozeuf24zyxqzog1mdhd.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"这下必须还你一个人情了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/74/dnpg9mwa577xmx3kfdo73glgpptfxy6.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"哈，你怎么看起来比我要得意？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/54/5fmb261pqreva02vznvw4svcyh4ah7r.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"我喜欢力量和希望的信号，会让我感觉未来一切向好。这并非悲观，只是陈述事实，因为现实本就不可能一帆风顺。但有个好消息，就是当坏事发生时，我们可以站在同一阵线，对吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/gebsa0k1flg6aschkhspap0ekzo5k5f.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"开始吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/6uv1u6300g00w1804e2aap0tbdavvyo.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"别跑啊。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/hmnkeoce6m3zz37z58oabaizso38g1m.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"请留步。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/9sv48wdlapw30tm4hb1l376t8hx0mmn.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"一路顺风。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a1/rvoezxw7f162qir9nhj1w3ft711s89p.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"注意防寒。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/3d61i76528v6jnuep8704lru9q0pjs9.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"无需畏惧，直面罪责。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/5f0cvdowda0u1edx3pqfjngy8s9kab7.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"没有锁吗？真方便啊。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/47/pbik9by3daonwqtiec17e2ss6qmwsxo.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"先收好吧，总能派上用场。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/rlilvcdyyp22t3fov6bmq2vj21pzvsb.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"无主之物最好归公…所以这里什么都没有，对吧？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/67/sf7u9zio1y5ijds6kh58gxlutfd23qi.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"不慌。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/68/pq5rh63azanebcsvjf0l3kcsgo49eym.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"不叫增援？也行。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/kyofplzuwuhekm5sixl2p1iqcgm3q1d.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"见机行事。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/00/awf6k8js31bb3lvp3xe217g45nqf26i.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"退后。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/j49712wx2buq596ovur71eqgzsvulti.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"去医务室。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/16/75ftpdpvke1gwmmn71xannp1oyx0wgv.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"抱歉，没能守住…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/2l1j09zevebfomrbove8rij0e724pur.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"孤注一掷的后果…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/73/feea1cyblgd1hqhg2s4lqgh3grttvwx.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"我没有异议。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/7fqhd4lu0whzqjoqs6lv58ztf3kna9h.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"这么客气？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_hit_L_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/6zlfqki93kobvg4a2ynezaxbvzh6gnp.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"…还可以。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_wriothesley/vo_wriothesley_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/llf6v5r5a9ific68o5boouqwgqvmcky.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"开工。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_wriothesley_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/91m24jyz1qd5er4q7a8jpf8j25cvpkm.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"请我出外勤？走。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_wriothesley_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/4lmpg26o6r5f6t7inlwr9ykqz8e1zn4.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"我尽力，但不保证赢。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_wriothesley_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/q62v1kc2rbemxqyvyw1l1x0rst3toej.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000086-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000086-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1500,"fullArtHeight":845}